  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Development Assistance for responsAbility Climate Smart Agriculture Fund TA Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The technical assistance will support the Funds Technical Assistance Facility (TAF), which will support the Fund in identifying and enabling investments that reduce negative societal impacts and address inefficiencies associated with food value chains. The TAF will also support the development of climate risk management strategies for its investees and strengthen investees capacities to meet the Funds objectives of climate change mitigation and adaptation.</narrative>
  </description>
